{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARCH WIZARD is a fast paced First Person &quot;Hyper Shooter&quot;:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight battlefields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A few very distinct enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tricks in your sleeve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot mechanics to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend all your moves, skills and abilities into one personalized flow of magic rage. A calculated ever adapting dance between enemies. Using their attacks and even detached body parts to dig into the depths of combat spell craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a powerful mage. Lost in the ruins of warp portal network,\u00a0once connecting the outskirts of the multiverse.<br>You must fight your way through cosmoses.<br>First \u2014 to get back to your Tower.<br>Second \u2014 to establish dominance on the parallel realms.<br>To go back from THE OTHER SIDE.<br>To find the source of Chaos.<br>To face the End of the World<br>To become the eternal ARCH WIZARD \u2014 an architect, a director, a tailor of your own fait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knowledge based progression. High scores. Full of secrets.<br><br>Trailer music contains tracks: Shadows And Dust by <strong><i>Scott Buckley </i></strong>and\u00a0Creepy Dark Atmosphere by\u00a0<strong><i>Universfield</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/955010?t=1761657746","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/955010?t=1761657746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955010/3ce76a15255dc936415af09be0d1917784d9e18b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761657746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/955010/3ce76a15255dc93641